# Logs
# Anchored to the repo root on purpose. Unanchored, `logs/` matches a directory named "logs" at ANY
# depth — which silently excluded apps/web/src/app/host/logs/ (the host console's log viewer route)
# from a commit, so the page 404'd in production while `git status` reported a clean tree. Runtime log
# output only ever lands at the root, and the other two logs/ directories in this repo (.run/logs,
# apps/web/.next/dev/logs) are already covered by their own rules.
/logs/
*.log

# Docker volumes / local data
.data/
.run/

# Local attachment blobs (LocalDiskFileStorage default root)
App_Data/

# Graphify - commit the generated graph, skip local cache/state
graphify-out/cache/
graphify-out/cost.json
graphify-out/.graphify_root
graphify-out/.graphify_analysis.json
graphify-out/[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]/
